"Boards belong to teams and any member of that team can be granted access "
"to a board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/share-and-collaborate.rst:12
msgid ""
"If your boards workspace looks different, you may be on an earlier "
"version of boards. In earlier versions, boards are tied to channel "
"workspaces and board membership is determined by channel membership. In "
"this case, roles and permissions won't be applicable to you."
